    "actClause": "AN ACT to amend the election law, in relation to ballots submitted in\nenvelopes that are sealed with tape, paste or any other binding agent or\ndevice and have no indication of tampering",
    "basePrintNo": "S6195",
    "basePrintNoStr": "S6195-2023",
